],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "bd73ddbe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "0e8fdeec",
"en_raw": "Why do you talk to me"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "6026ebf3",
"en_raw": "after saying that?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "79623cd0",
"en_raw": "Well, that's..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "d3eeac49",
"en_raw": "...True"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "bd73ddbe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki..."
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "58b8e21a",
"en_raw": "Well, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "bd73ddbe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "11a6b4d1",
"en_raw": "Why do you talk to me?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "5c2942ae",
"en_raw": "I don't know what"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1c63195a",
"en_raw": "to do..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e740846e",
"en_raw": "But if you act like that"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "43c107e4",
"en_raw": "nobody will deal with you"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "b6ad00be",
"en_raw": "But I said terrible things"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "01dd5f5d",
"en_raw": "to Hirauchi too..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "50ff2a5c",
"en_raw": "Did I get told something?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ce0c629d",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "7525cc9d",
"en_raw": "Well, anyway, let's get along"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "3b7149e0",
"en_raw": "We're both outcasts, so why not"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "8c4564cc",
"en_raw": "Yo"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "9c7ba5db",
"en_raw": "After all, I'll"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "7a16c1f4",
"en_raw": "follow Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f7a383a9",
"en_raw": "Please look after me"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "baa35876",
"en_raw": "Oh, Hirauchi!"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "1762dafb",
"en_raw": "How are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "b71edacc",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "d8342ab8",
"en_raw": "What are Hirauchi's real hobbies"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "322f8cb4",
"en_raw": "like?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "e86919c9",
"en_raw": "It's not late-night anime"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "9a646ec9",
"en_raw": "that much is certain"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8c4776d8",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "11f650f5",
"en_raw": "Is there something else?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "2a60e82a",
"en_raw": "Something else, you..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "13428ac6",
"en_raw": "There are tons, of course"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a9a65274",
"en_raw": "What I want to know"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "04f3b25b",
"en_raw": "are Hirauchi's se-crets"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "17610dd8",
"en_raw": "you know!"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "786e8d67",
"en_raw": "Was making up"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "87ae2515",
"en_raw": "the right call, I wonder..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "6c6654a4",
"en_raw": "Geez, don't tease me"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "7d9b3987",
"en_raw": "tell me, please"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "7287f84f",
"en_raw": "It's not a secret or anything"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "91d7ec52",
"en_raw": "Ordinary Japanese novels"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "9f115d4c",
"en_raw": "and such"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "2316e485",
"en_raw": "Oh, like the ones in"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "b04407d7",
"en_raw": "Japanese textbooks?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "150252c3",
"en_raw": "Those too, maybe..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "dc7bef4f",
"en_raw": "What I especially like is"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "c569c87d",
"en_raw": "early Showa pure literature"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "88f5eb35",
"en_raw": "The sharp, delicate"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "4f06acef",
"en_raw": "depictions of inner life are good"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "67aaf290",
"en_raw": "Oh, is that so?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "061eaf35",
"en_raw": "Do you understand what that means?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "e2fc4194",
"en_raw": "Of course!"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "d16ae7c4",
"en_raw": "I might get interested"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c8a890bf",
"en_raw": "in that stuff too"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "53ca0ae0",
"en_raw": "I'll try reading"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "9ee3ed69",
"en_raw": "a book like that sometime~"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "4119a299",
"en_raw": "Geez, you're so secretive!"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "cb5f4e4f",
"en_raw": "That's also good, though..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b71edacc",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "3d15ee51",
"en_raw": "What are you looking so happy about?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "1ffec96b",
"en_raw": "So Melos was a human"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "48091079",
"en_raw": "No, what you know"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "ef373237",
"en_raw": "is a mongrel dog"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "11fb3cd5",
"en_raw": "No, that's not it"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "93abccd9",
"en_raw": "Um, I read it"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "dfe67132",
"en_raw": "...Run, Melos"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "4260401b",
"en_raw": "...and I thought it was amazing"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "5c372dcf",
"en_raw": "What part?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "fcd2b2e3",
"en_raw": "Um, well, ha ha"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "2986fb2b",
"en_raw": "When I look at text"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "eb7238bd",
"en_raw": "I get drowsy"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "a7fc55ee",
"en_raw": "So what part"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "6236c833",
"en_raw": "did you like?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "a1c95f8e",
"en_raw": "Um... Senn..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "c9d5c8c8",
"en_raw": "Selinuntius"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "f546531c",
"en_raw": "Right, right, that guy"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "b4997863",
"en_raw": "His name is hard to read, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "59e04177",
"en_raw": "Sorry, Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "c50faf65",
"en_raw": "don't talk to me anymore"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "1e04d8e3",
"en_raw": "I feel like I'd become"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "b1e0e6e1",
"en_raw": "stupid too..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "f6c3844b",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I'll try"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "2a38e718",
"en_raw": "to improve more..."
}
]
}